## Integration acceptance

- Exercise created, partially uploaded, invalid-key and interrupted states with synthetic archives in a safe test installation.
- Verify confirmation names contents and replacement consequences before any restore action.
- Audit evidence must distinguish file rollback, backup integrity and a separately executed restore test.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

